  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Can Daga Alyera Farmers Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Can Daga is a farmers cooperative focused on increasing the production and the bulking maize and sunflowers. USADF funds are used to upgrade the financial systems of the group, purchase a milling machine, and provide technical training to farmer members.</narrative>
  </description>
